console.log(camelToSnake('HelloWorld'));  // Output: hello_world
console.log(camelToSnake('myVariableName'));  // Output: my_variable_name
console.log(camelToSnake('ThisIsAnAcronym'));  // Output: this_is_an_acronym
console.log(camelToSnake('Some__string'));  // Output: some__string
```

Note that consecutive underscores are allowed in the resulting snake_case string if they exist in the input string."}]

