[{"role": "assistant", "content": "There are several diff algorithms out there like Myers diff algorithm, Patience diff algorithm, etc. but to get it working in JavaScript for HTML content, you may want to look into certain libraries or packages. One such library is "diff2html" which is based on "jsdiff" to render side-by-side diff or line-by-line diff of any text-based content, including HTML.

