let sortedArray = insertionSort(array);
let finalArray = sortEvenIndexed(sortedArray);

console.log(finalArray); // logs: [ 8, 1, 6, 2, 5, 3, 4, 7 ]
```

The insertion sort algorithm works by iterating through the array from left to right, at each point comparing the current element with the previous elements and shifting those elements to the right until finding the correct position for the current element.

